{"video":"gO8N3L_aERg","lines":[{"t":[0,28.7],"en":"Last week, I gave a fire safety talk."},{"t":[30,32],"en":"And nobody paid any attention."},{"t":[33.1,35.2],"en":"It's my own fault for using PowerPoint."},{"t":[36,37],"en":"PowerPoint is boring."},{"t":[38,39.7],"en":"People learn in lots of different ways."},{"t":[40.3,43.1],"en":"But experience is the best teacher."},{"t":[48.4,51.4],"en":"Today, smoking is going to save lives."},{"t":[60,72.4],"en":"Does anyone smell anything smoky?"},{"t":[73.1,74.8],"en":"Did you bring your jerky in again?"},{"t":[77.6,81.4],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[81.6,82.3],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[83.6,84.1],"en":"Fire!"},{"t":[84.3,85],"en":"Oh, fire!"},{"t":[85.2,85.8],"en":"Oh, my goodness!"},{"t":[86,86.9],"en":"What's the procedure?"},{"t":[87.3,88.3],"en":"What do we do, people?"},{"t":[88.3,90.6],"en":"Oh, how did that happen?"},{"t":[90.6,91.5],"en":"It's out in the hall."},{"t":[91.6,92.5],"en":"No, we don't know that."},{"t":[92.6,93.9],"en":"The smoke could be coming through an air duct."},{"t":[94,94.7],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[94.8,95.6],"en":"Okay, it's happening."},{"t":[95.9,96.8],"en":"Everybody stay calm."},{"t":[96.9,98],"en":"What's the procedure, everyone?"},{"t":[98.1,98.8],"en":"What's the procedure?"},{"t":[98.9,99.8],"en":"Stay calm!"},{"t":[100.1,100.7],"en":"Wait, wait, wait, wait."},{"t":[100.9,102.3],"en":"Let's let your calm down!"},{"t":[102.5,103.6],"en":"No, no, Michael, no!"},{"t":[103.9,104.6],"en":"Touch the handle."},{"t":[104.8,106.5],"en":"If it's hot, there could be a fire in the hallway."},{"t":[108.7,109.6],"en":"What does warm mean?"},{"t":[109.7,110.1],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[110.2,110.8],"en":"Try to get the door."},{"t":[110.9,112],"en":"Not a viable option."},{"t":[112.3,112.9],"en":"What next?"},{"t":[112.9,113.4],"en":"Don't run!"},{"t":[113.4,113.9],"en":"Come to the other door."},{"t":[114,115.2],"en":"Oh, here's the door."},{"t":[115.4,116.2],"en":"Check that one out."},{"t":[116.3,117],"en":"How's the handle?"},{"t":[117.3,118],"en":"And it's warm."},{"t":[118.1,118.6],"en":"Okay, go to the back door."},{"t":[118.6,119.9],"en":"Well, another option."},{"t":[120,120.8],"en":"Another option."},{"t":[121.2,122.8],"en":"Jeez, okay, settle down, everyone."},{"t":[122.9,123.9],"en":"No, I forgot my purse."},{"t":[124,124.9],"en":"Leave it, woman!"},{"t":[125.2,125.6],"en":"Get out of the way."},{"t":[125.7,126.2],"en":"Go, go, go!"},{"t":[126.2,127.7],"en":"No, things can be replaced, Phyllis."},{"t":[128,130.6],"en":"People, human lives, however, can..."},{"t":[130.6,134.4],"en":"Ah, my hand!"},{"t":[134.5,135],"en":"That's hot!"},{"t":[135.3,136.6],"en":"Nah, this one's hot, too!"},{"t":[136.8,138.7],"en":"Okay, we're trapped, everyone, for himself!"},{"t":[138.9,140.5],"en":"Okay, okay, let's go, let's go!"},{"t":[140.6,141.2],"en":"Get out of my way!"},{"t":[141.5,142.4],"en":"Okay, okay."},{"t":[143,143.4],"en":"Call."},{"t":[143.8,144.7],"en":"Get out of the way!"},{"t":[144.9,146.3],"en":"Have you ever seen a burn victim?"},{"t":[146.8,147.4],"en":"Move it!"},{"t":[147.4,149.6],"en":"Okay, procedure, procedure."},{"t":[150.6,151.5],"en":"Exit options."},{"t":[151.9,153],"en":"Where do we go, folks?"},{"t":[153.1,154.7],"en":"Use a what to cover the mouth?"},{"t":[154.8,155.2],"en":"A what?"},{"t":[155.6,156.6],"en":"A rag."},{"t":[156.6,157.8],"en":"A damp rag, perhaps."},{"t":[158.7,160.3],"en":"Let's remember those procedures."},{"t":[160.5,161.3],"en":"What are the options?"},{"t":[161.6,163.2],"en":"Okay, that's the wrong way."},{"t":[163.3,164.3],"en":"We've already tried that."},{"t":[164.7,166.2],"en":"Remember your exit points."},{"t":[166.4,167.5],"en":"Exit points, people."},{"t":[167.6,168.1],"en":"What's next?"},{"t":[168.1,168.4],"en":"Oscar!"},{"t":[168.6,168.8],"en":"Huh?"},{"t":[168.9,170.3],"en":"Stay alive, I'm getting help!"},{"t":[170.5,171.1],"en":"Pull me up!"},{"t":[171.2,171.9],"en":"You're too heavy!"},{"t":[172,173.4],"en":"I only weigh 82 pounds!"},{"t":[174.4,175.6],"en":"Safe bandit!"},{"t":[179,180.4],"en":"How about 9-1-1?"},{"t":[180.5,180.8],"en":"Anyone?"},{"t":[181,181.6],"en":"9-1-1."},{"t":[192.2,193.2],"en":"What do we do?"},{"t":[193.5,195.5],"en":"Use the surge of fear and adrenaline"},{"t":[195.5,196.9],"en":"to sharpen your decision-making!"},{"t":[197.1,198.2],"en":"Okay, I am not dying here."},{"t":[198.3,198.5],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[202.7,203.7],"en":"What is that?"},{"t":[203.8,204.4],"en":"What is that?"},{"t":[204.5,206.3],"en":"The fire's shooting at us!"},{"t":[206.9,209.2],"en":"What in the name of Kyle is going on?"},{"t":[216.5,217.7],"en":"Go, go, go, go, go, go, go!"},{"t":[228.9,236.9],"en":"Attention employees of Dunder Mifflin."},{"t":[236.9,240.4],"en":"This has been a test of our emergency preparedness."},{"t":[240.4,241.3],"en":"There is no fire."},{"t":[241.3,243],"en":"It was only a simulation."},{"t":[243,243.8],"en":"What?"},{"t":[243.8,245.3],"en":"Fire, not real."},{"t":[245.3,248.7],"en":"This was merely a training exercise."},{"t":[248.7,251.4],"en":"So what have we learned?"},{"t":[251.4,252.4],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[252.4,253.8],"en":"It's not real, Stanley."},{"t":[253.8,254.7],"en":"Don't have a heart attack."},{"t":[254.7,255.7],"en":"No, no, no, no, no, no."},{"t":[255.7,256.5],"en":"You will not die."},{"t":[256.5,259],"en":"Stanley, Stanley, you will not die."},{"t":[259,262.2],"en":"Stanley, Stanley, Barack is president."},{"t":[262.2,263.8],"en":"You are black, Stanley."},{"t":[263.8,264.8],"en":"I'm going to give him mouth to mouth."},{"t":[264.8,265],"en":"No, no, no, no."},{"t":[265,266.5],"en":"Don't give him mouth to mouth for this."},{"t":[266.5,267.8],"en":"You're going to swallow this tongue."},{"t":[267.8,268.6],"en":"Open your mouth."},{"t":[268.6,269.1],"en":"Michael."},{"t":[269.1,271.4],"en":"Don't swallow it."},{"t":[271.4,272.2],"en":"I'm fine."},{"t":[272.2,272.9],"en":"Leave me alone."}]}
